        "id": 252509,
        "name": "QuirkyDM",
        "username": "QuirkyDM",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-05-07T15:08:39.402Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Advanced Omnitron interrupts an important debate between Freedom Six Absolute Zero, Xtreme Prime Wardens Tempest, Ra: Setting Sun, and Xtreme Prime Wardens Fanatic. Perhaps he’s upset because they didn’t discuss how important technology was to the Fire Nation’s position?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d573cc936146eecd2d7cdb6280a8d63d1f9e2e8e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/d573cc936146eecd2d7cdb6280a8d63d1f9e2e8e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d573cc936146eecd2d7cdb6280a8d63d1f9e2e8e_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ushNzZ9hTc4Rh48vwmwjtpDfuHk\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d573cc936146eecd2d7cdb6280a8d63d1f9e2e8e_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d573cc936146eecd2d7cdb6280a8d63d1f9e2e8e_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d573cc936146eecd2d7cdb6280a8d63d1f9e2e8e_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/d573cc936146eecd2d7cdb6280a8d63d1f9e2e8e_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 103 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Nothing too ridiculous here, though the heroes’ health was getting into worrisome levels. Quick tip (that is obvious to anyone who knows how to play properly) - Electro-Pulse Explosive is not a good target for Tempest’s base power. The team took some unnecessary damage thinking Tempest had negated that attack, though it was hardly a hidden assault- just my own failure at reading the cards properly.</p>",
