        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Advanced Omnitron interrupts an important debate between Freedom Six Absolute Zero, Xtreme Prime Wardens Tempest, Ra: Setting Sun, and Xtreme Prime Wardens Fanatic. Perhaps he's upset because they didn't discuss how important technology was to the Fire Nation's position?\n\n![image|231x500](upload://ushNzZ9hTc4Rh48vwmwjtpDfuHk.jpeg)\n\nNothing too ridiculous here, though the heroes' health was getting into worrisome levels. Quick tip (that is obvious to anyone who knows how to play properly) - Electro-Pulse Explosive is not a good target for Tempest's base power. The team took some unnecessary damage thinking Tempest had negated that attack, though it was hardly a hidden assault- just my own failure at reading the cards properly.",
