        "cooked": "<p>Well, I was wrong about what the next game would be! Guess we’re taking a break from Earth-Prime for a bit.</p>\n<p>But yeah, this wasn’t too hard. I got AZ killed because I couldn’t find a cooling unit so I just went full-fire and blasted everything, but otherwise it was an easy win.</p>",
